{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：19:47 2026-11-10 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"吳若希被《東周刊》獨家爆拍《愛回家》透支暈倒入院  親認健康亮紅燈：唔知睇邊科\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl_square/3e8e13cb0b750897554815f1ca42b09a/2026-11/Copy_of_Copy_of_KF_74.png\"/>\n<p>最新一期《東周刊》報道，在TVB處境劇《愛•回家之三代同糖》擔正「女一」的吳若希（Jinny），早前劇情交代角色被派往非洲「吳旺達」後暫別螢幕，隨即傳出因收視欠佳遭調離劇組；報道更指她因日夜顛倒拍劇導致體力透支暈倒入院，日前為細仔豪擲逾15萬籌辦生日派對時，更被目擊面青兼手震。對此，吳若希今日（10日）回覆《星島頭條》時親認身體亮紅燈，澄清是因過勞抱恙才暫別劇組，並非被踢出局。</p>\n<h2>吳若希認手震未知睇邊科</h2>\n<p>談及目前的健康狀況，吳若希回覆《星島頭條》時坦言正計劃前往醫院求診：「係有手震嘅，係要check嘅，不過唔知搵邊科。」對於手震成因，她懷疑可能與平日缺乏鍛鍊、肌肉量不足有關，並樂觀表示：「做返啲運動會好啲」，透露稍後會抽時間調理身體及加強運動，釋除外界對其健康的擔憂。</p>\n<img alt=\"最新一期《東周刊》，獨家爆吳若希「離家」真相。（《東周刊》提供圖片）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f83b2a1314ced9b88544675545e5e774/2026-11/1_1_11.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳若希被拍得面青口唇白手震震。（《東周刊》提供圖片）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e55c11c701d2a3d48999a68c4510826d/2026-11/2_3_4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"在10月中播出的第49集，吳若希終於「喊住離家」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f330b3ea8e9f8be9d87bf50284edc8ce/2026-10/VS--49--myTVSUPER-11_43_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"高冠一」容天佑以升為副總裁為名，實情將吳若希「發配邊疆」調到吳旺達\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/426db0253e9b6918abd5e4b4fe6bc263/2026-10/VS--49--myTVSUPER-11_51_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"對白句句若有所指。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8d8cf9ff7516ee8d8490a7ec8905ce5f/2026-10/VS--49--myTVSUPER-11_52_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"「呢個世界又冇話冇咗邊唔得」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a6ba2e7c5cd242ad61b69632c47478fa/2026-10/VS--49--myTVSUPER-12_00_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"安多勳（關曜儁飾）為了救吳若希穿上貼身拉丁舞衣跳舒舞。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/04626cd745e881b31128c5b978accaa1/2026-10/VS--49--myTVSUPER-15_50_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\" Lilian（吳芷默飾）一句：「呢件事就係畀個教訓妳，嘢係唔可以亂講。」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f0806b7aed5f19c8dfcc4c9bfec3b55e/2026-10/VS--49--myTVSUPER-16_14_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"結果引來不少質疑聲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c7dfd98cd7aa0df87e6eaea7129152b2/2026-10/VS--49--myTVSUPER-16_23_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"女兒「唐芯」李茵彤同「唐曹嘉冰」車婉婉幫吳若希執包袱。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7321375efc88c509ababda5c904ca81b/2026-10/VS--49--myTVSUPER-16_35_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"女兒「唐芯」李茵彤有啲唔捨得。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cb0f624a4de1f31d80f0517d97667c5f/2026-10/VS--49--myTVSUPER-17_23_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"送上全家福。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d32c50e097f81b833754d074f863d638/2026-10/VS--49--myTVSUPER-17_31_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳若希今次被流放的演出，竟然得到網民的認同。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7f2e98e9d31f28d43c5e7e9d4843d01e/2026-10/VS--49--myTVSUPER-17_55_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳若希含淚將這個家託付給媽媽「唐曹嘉冰」車婉婉。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c8e156ad45cec12b044bc496c9412ee3/2026-10/VS--49--myTVSUPER-18_27_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有人說：「其實吳若希真係好慘。」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b2f8572e5fc7dc318769fcc8e33f261b/2026-10/VS--49--myTVSUPER-18_44_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"呢個畫面好感人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b0a19eb3c2cf044bdca337488d2439ec/2026-10/VS--49--myTVSUPER-18_51_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳若希暫無歸期。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/122839249e528dde785927e2e06fc501/2026-10/VS--49--myTVSUPER-19_42_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"車婉婉受訪時亦證實第50集後的劇本確實已完全沒有吳若希的戲份。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ff553a570e8e5f929eec9c41bf242965/2026-10/VS--49--myTVSUPER-19_44_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"「三代同糖」卻缺少了一人，被網民質疑是否需要改劇名。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1c0a9c7feddc9bcb0e9e5cd38db6ecd9/2026-10/__logo.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"成個家靜晒。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3af7767b67ae8ae86fe6eae08168b07f/2026-10/VS--49--myTVSUPER-20_12_.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:22.690464+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":363,"images":21,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T11:47:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T17:18:03.256503+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:51.493083+00:00","content_hash":"b68c72d78a7c89ca992e080b1202f02b7f2ce5133374e8209d1ed2d4f126b78b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}